meta {
  name: Sign In Email
  type: http
  seq: 2
}

post {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/api/auth/sign-in/email
  body: json
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Content-Type: application/json
}

body:json {
  {
    "email": "jane.doe@example.com",
    "password": "StrongPassword123!"
  }
}

script:post-response {
  if (res.body && res.body.token) {
    bru.setEnvVar("sessionToken", res.body.token);
  }
}

docs {
  # Sign In with Email and Password

  Authenticates an existing user with email and password via Better Auth (`POST /api/auth/sign-in/email`).

  ## Request Body
  | Field | Type | Required | Description |
  | --- | --- | --- | --- |
  | `email` | `string` | Yes | Registered email address. |
  | `password` | `string` | Yes | Account password. |
  | `rememberMe` | `boolean` | No | Whether to persist the session beyond browser closure. |

  ## Responses
  - **200 OK**: Returns user details and session token, and sets the `better-auth.session_token` cookie.
  - **401 Unauthorized**: Invalid email or password.
}

